('node-12-5', 'phase-12-lesson-05-agent-memory-systems-working-memory-episo', 'module-13', 5, 'Lesson 13.5: Agent Memory Systems: Working Memory, Episodic Memory & Semantic Memory', 'Prerequisites: Phase 10, Lesson 12.1', 'Prerequisites: Phase 10, Lesson 12.1 | Subtopics: 6 items', 'Systems project application', 340, 13, 3120.0, 250.0, '# Lesson 12.5: Agent Memory Systems: Working Memory, Episodic Memory & Semantic Memory

